OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLight rain
OL,6,Fwill persist across many areas through
OL,7,Fthe evening, increasingly turning to
OL,8,Fdrizzle. Some dry spells will develop
OL,9,Ffrom the west later, with most places
OL,10,Fpotentially dry by the end of the
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cloudy but largely dry
OL,14,Fstart. Brighter conditions with sunny
OL,15,Fspells will develop through the
OL,16,Fmorning, while scattered showers
OL,17,Fspread eastwards, becoming heavy and
OL,18,Fperhaps thundery later, especially
OL,19,Facross Derbyshire.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
