OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fbreezy with sunny spells and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers, locally heavy. Increasingly
OL,8,Fcloudy and breezy on Tuesday, with
OL,9,Fheavy rain spreading south-eastwards
OL,10,Fmid-afternoon. Mostly dry and sunny on
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
